OL,3,GNEWSAPolice step up patrols in city
OL,4,Acrime 'hotspots'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Wolverhampton are stepping up
OL,7,Fefforts to keep the city centre and
OL,8,Fshopping areas safe, with visible
OL,9,Fpatrols and enforcement activity in
OL,10,F"hotspot areas".
OL,12,FWest Midlands Police said officers in
OL,13,Fthe city centre had arrested six people
OL,14,Fin the last week for offences including
OL,15,Fvehicle theft and burglary, as well as
OL,16,Fmore than 25 shop thefts.
OL,18,FOne man, who was wanted on recall to
OL,19,Fprison, was charged in connection with
OL,20,F18 shop thefts, after #2,000 of items
OL,21,Fincluding clothes and food were stolen.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
