OL,3,GNEWSAPolice step up patrols in city
OL,4,Acrime 'hotspots'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree other men were detained after
OL,7,Fitems were stolen from shops and
OL,8,Fparcels taken from a communal area of
OL,9,Fflats, the force said, with a further
OL,10,Fman and a woman arrested following
OL,11,Fvehicle theft.
